/*
  TemperatureMetricCards.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0161 · TemperatureMetricCards (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TemperatureMetricCards` resolves (table "TemperatureMetricCards") lives here with its web
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns
  its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/TemperatureMetricCards.tsx and the `sensors`
  array its parent DrivetrainHealthPage builds) — the canonical `drivetrain.*` namespace. The
  remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness chip, stale/offline banner, loading +
  error + retry copy, empty hint).
*/

